  <ees' f' g' aes'>4 r4 r2 |
  R1\fermata | R1*2 |
  %% IV. E-flat major, one chord a bar, rising and falling
  aes8\pp c' ees' g' aes' g' ees' c' aes c' |
  bes8 ees' g' bes' ees'' bes' g' ees' bes ees' |
  aes8 c' ees' aes' c'' aes' ees' c' aes c' |
